{"symbol":"KER.WA","area":"poland","updated":"2026-11-09T19:52:35Z","info":{"address1":"8A, Boulevard Joseph II","address2":"L-1840","city":"Luxembourg","country":"Luxembourg","website":"https://www.kernel.ua","industry":"Food Distribution","industryKey":"food-distribution","industryDisp":"Food Distribution","sector":"Consumer Defensive","sectorKey":"consumer-defensive","sectorDisp":"Consumer Defensive","longBusinessSummary":"Kernel Holding S.A., together with its subsidiaries, engages in the diversified vertically integrated agricultural business in Ukraine and internationally. The company operates through three segments: Oilseed Processing, Infrastructure and Trading, and Farming. It is involved in sunflower seed origination and sunflower oil production; sells bottled and bulk sunflower oil, and sunflower meal; produces electricity from sunflower musk; agricultural farming; production of corn, wheat, soybean, sunflower seed, rapeseed, and minor crops, as well as forage, pea, and barley; and cattle farming operation. The company also engages in sourcing and merchandising wholesale edible oils and grain; provision of silo services; operating the fleet of logistics assets for inland transportation and vessels; and grain and sunflower oil handling and transshipment services. In addition, it trades in sunflower oil, meals, and grains; and operates grain elevators. The company was founded in 1995 and is based in Luxembourg, Luxembourg. Kernel Holding S.A. operates as a subsidiary of Namsen Limited.","fullTimeEmployees":12923,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Andrii  Verevskyi","age":51,"title":"Founder & Chairman of the Board","yearBorn":1974,"fiscalYear":2009,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Anastasiia  Usachova CFM, CMA","age":54,"title":"Executive Director","yearBorn":1971,"fiscalYear":2009,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Yevgen  Osypov","age":49,"title":"CEO & Executive Director","yearBorn":19